WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
[A carnival waltz begins.]

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.500
Pip traces three rebounds
before firing his pearl.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Mabel’s wide basket catches the pearl
beneath the turning Moonwheel.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.000
[Bright, rising peg notes] Tiko’s sparks
split again. Two pearls land in the basket.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A bubble current lifts Nori’s pearl
back between the boats.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Vesper’s echo lights a whole ring
of pegs inside the crown.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Brass sends a meteor straight
through a row of pegs.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Juniper’s vine bends and springs
the falling pearl back up.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A single hit lights the orange suns
in Luma’s constellation.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Final flourish] The last sun opens
the scoring pockets below the lantern.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
All eight performers take a bow.
The carnival is alight.
